<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia November inflation down to 8.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovenia November inflation down to 8.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>CONSUMER PRICE INFLATION</p>
<p>    (changes in percent)	    Nov  Oct  Nov 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	   0.4  0.8  1.3</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	     8.6  9.7  9.1</p>
<p>-- Marja Novak, Ljubljana newsroom, 396-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
